{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lRCiyWvneR1794756092.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港都會大學有資料外洩，涉及5,000人。</p><p></p><p>校方本月4日發現一宗保安事故，即時啟動緊急應變機制，並已聘請獨立第三方資訊保安顧問協助全面檢視。初步調查顯示，部分人的個人資料或受到影響，包括姓名、出生日期、電話號碼等，以及曾繳交學費的日期和金額，但不涉及銀行戶口號碼。</p><p></p><p>大學用電郵通知可能受影響人士，並將事件通報警方。私隱專員公署稱，接獲都大通報，就事故展開調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:05:03.809242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T15:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T23:53:59.751509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:57:00.264295+00:00","content_hash":"eb8de19da7f475df9ae163521b8b0a5630845750167be4bbfd476d4ec7ae20d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:05:03.809242+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}